Package: BIBCRE
Title: Bayesian Index-based Control Rule Evaluations
Version: 0.4
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul", "Medley", , "paulahmedley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package is able to test whether an HCR achieves objectives 
    based on a series of plausible stock assessment model fits. This is an 
    extension to three data limited stock assessments. 1. state space
    production model JABBA, 2. a Stan version of JABBA and 3. a length-based 
    catch curve fishblicc. The package uses posterior (MCMC parameter) draws from these 
    models in projections to test simple index-based linear harvest control 
    rules. These are management strategy evaluations in that the linear index-based HCR is
    simpler than the stock assessment operating model, but constrained to the
    data limited stock assessments. 
